                <custos xml:id="m-2dd17bf5-1914-4a20-bac9-6e21c9f6ab9f" facs="#m-4e6ab37d-f7a6-4eba-a2f9-88e3ec60b477" pname="e" oct="3" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-9cbcb151-4c46-4dd3-bf60-a3ee04202757">
              <lg xml:id="m-12081b37-06d4-47ce-830f-0133988a2ae2">
                <l xml:id="m-257ef49c-afb6-4b1b-9dc2-a8cda1fd495d" facs="#m-e368bc9f-d72e-413c-b245-858611a48b43" label="text-like">At Matins (2nd Nocturn)</l><l xml:id="m-71ee5890-6364-4f6c-ae74-2d3473729044" facs="#m-3d16ae3f-7a8b-4d97-a776-2f38de21706e" label="ambiguous">767</l><l xml:id="m-b50fa831-46c4-4ad8-9734-0721e1a1342f" facs="#m-97542836-a25f-42ac-a45f-d2638f8ba8a5" label="lyrics-like">prióre. Ait illis Pilátus : Habétis niérunt sepúlcrum, signántes lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-abded8e4-f65c-4f6a-b2da-58334ce16fd6" facs="#m-bc075d8a-cbe5-4667-9797-96be28258695" label="lyrics-like">custódiam, ite, custodite sicut pidem cum custódibus.</l><l xml:id="m-cbd1189f-79fe-4839-8fe4-4660f486ef74" facs="#m-0bbb8e8c-1612-4dac-82d9-fe9cb93b9756" label="lyrics-like">scitis. Illi autem abeúntes mu¬</l><l xml:id="m-264dde8b-84c4-4147-accf-176f04a62875" facs="#m-47d2fe47-24bc-497b-886f-f21712d44764" label="ambiguous">Resp.6</l><l xml:id="m-083e39b6-0bf4-44cd-a7d5-ac9a73175667" facs="#m-0a15b4a5-6543-4e5b-b9c7-886102f7f6ef" label="ambiguous">9</l><l xml:id="m-09cf761a-dc8b-417a-88b8-028ddd2088d2" facs="#m-2e8c5a5f-3a3d-476e-a00f-47cafc93159f" label="lyrics-like">vos ómnes,“ qui transí-tis per ví-am,</l><l xml:id="m-5199ad00-ffef-4b40-ba49-93a6abd3c93f" facs="#m-bb251b65-8aa7-4e02-9d3e-bd485d53914c" label="lyrics-like">attén¬</l><l xml:id="m-a60a53d6-ce74-44d0-a4f9-b875f587af79" facs="#m-bbd25e8b-5eee-4ef0-8ad5-6eaf1be41004" label="lyrics-like">di-te, et vidé-te</l><l xml:id="m-6498dfda-d498-4828-8c9b-e1cb3d8e14cd" facs="#m-0f9dfc8d-2451-41a0-85e9-53554f140239" label="lyrics-like">"Si est dó-lor sí- mi- lis sic-ut</l><l xml:id="m-f47ecf74-c6bb-4a6b-95f3-36434933e7b1" facs="#m-9ceb1a65-158f-42ae-8432-f7e3b94db119" label="lyrics-like">dó-lor</l><l xml:id="m-aff3e985-fab3-46aa-8acf-2e4b59baccff" facs="#m-833c5dae-1862-491c-8a12-5b703428873e" label="lyrics-like">mé- us. V. Atténdi-te,</l><l xml:id="m-88483ebc-ecce-4cd4-91ca-36bee9904dd2" facs="#m-3313873f-2606-4b92-8ce2-e416d507f1cf" label="lyrics-like">u-ni-vérsi pó¬</l><l xml:id="m-4dd3d738-c009-4eae-bae1-94742c2674ce" facs="#m-849a309a-18fd-439e-aec2-ee260070518b" label="lyrics-like">pu- li, et vidé-te do¬ ló- rem mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb8583da-4e0a-44ee-a48a-2e1f1bd67366" facs="#m-e07bcb74-5410-4c7c-a5f5-20ed3bbb1ce0" label="ambiguous">um.“Si est.</l><l xml:id="m-935437ef-c1f1-4060-b676-65a0f0d9017e" facs="#m-42e389a3-b462-446b-8084-8309a0efc888" label="ambiguous">LESSON VI</l><l xml:id="m-334e4b8d-a86e-4f50-9ae9-d143f5d98124" facs="#m-780c970c-2a9c-45c6-839c-cd10f10d6b9f" label="lyrics-like">OOsuérunt custódes milites ad ejus, et abstulérunt eum. Vere</l><l xml:id="m-6b1d4a4e-fc12-4f33-81d4-e11fca8ee38b" facs="#m-c0d818ec-0fc5-42ba-b1b6-140ac6afc328" label="lyrics-like">sepúlcrum. Concússa terra defecérunt scrutántes scrutatió¬</l><l xml:id="m-b3429b13-cd5e-435c-9ab6-8d82d30cf30e" facs="#m-0dfd5385-9c38-4b5f-8dd6-18d1c357a2d4" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus resurréxit: mirácula</l><l xml:id="m-c88c0743-a6bb-4d9f-879c-7553af6dc436" facs="#m-717fcb27-616f-49e7-9e9e-cd51d71c0e57" label="ambiguous">nes. Quid est quod dixisti, o</l><l xml:id="m-9550a279-ed74-4e3c-a6a4-8097c078ca06" facs="#m-27f7c0e2-da81-424b-b13c-31b5e5d6948e" label="lyrics-like">infélix astútia? Tantúmne dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-17911f53-4f2b-48df-9e28-83c31b7e5507" facs="#m-ba63ebaa-c299-42ab-ae3f-1a0b5e9ca9f0" label="lyrics-like">facta sunt tália circa sepúlcrum,</l><l xml:id="m-3d8862e1-011c-4bca-85ae-7b85fc65e82f" facs="#m-b4571083-0e3b-4f0d-95ee-39bce99e5d50" label="ambiguous">seris lucem conssli pietatis, et</l><l xml:id="m-ef2a0ca9-5747-4a09-9b4d-307422cc0839" facs="#m-ed3f4b08-21a8-413c-88a6-e57f854a1157" label="lyrics-like">ut et ipsi milites, qui custódes</l><l xml:id="m-b40feecc-9416-4ec0-bba9-e3ab23f786f4" facs="#m-ad84acde-8d19-4af4-b54e-2991f6973688" label="lyrics-like">in profúnda versútiae demérge¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ae0d00a-1c81-459f-ad50-b4d02696cf44" facs="#m-bcbbffaf-f095-4c15-9cbf-0ef1c0fe6498" label="lyrics-like">advénerant, testes fierent, si</l><l xml:id="m-ad0cc334-c575-4373-b53a-8717513a26cf" facs="#m-d207941f-3d25-4782-9da0-9a93f8afb62d" label="ambiguous">ris, ut hoc dicas: Dicite quia</l><l xml:id="m-afa7e251-aa3e-4f44-ad93-4c7858393338" facs="#m-800e08e0-702c-4273-bbc3-d1edeb155870" label="lyrics-like">vellent vera nuntiãre. Sed ava¬</l><l xml:id="m-19d9e586-4ffd-45a1-abd4-0b0dba65dc78" facs="#m-776c8e3e-11b8-4d94-a2d0-c891297f7752" label="lyrics-like">vobis dormiéntibus venérunt di¬</l><l xml:id="m-2bbfd0d8-8a8c-4346-bf55-34fe9866ab25" facs="#m-300a2f65-c9f0-49c3-9973-638a0746430a" label="lyrics-like">nitia illa, quae captivávit disci¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e6c0898-3a00-4ce6-8276-4660b70d699f" facs="#m-7d16d947-f7b5-419d-bfbc-fab86e70320a" label="lyrics-like">scípuli ejus, et abstulérunt eum?</l><l xml:id="m-26a953c3-36bd-4db2-932b-80e575e28992" facs="#m-782912ba-dba1-494b-938c-60c1cbff45bd" label="lyrics-like">pulum cómitem Christi, captivá¬</l><l xml:id="m-d043e62d-ae01-4210-8d66-64ac871475a9" facs="#m-9e574278-9784-47ba-b162-b5ffec157d65" label="lyrics-like">vit et militem custódem sepúlcri.</l><l xml:id="m-0cbaa9df-a299-45e5-aaa0-78cbac52a670" facs="#m-37869b17-8cd0-4e68-8bad-faec358a5c3c" label="lyrics-like">Dormiéntes testes ádhibes: vere</l><l xml:id="m-914e2dc3-a40e-4179-a610-06e60dfe34e6" facs="#m-1311c3d7-6b1f-4783-a415-2c3867ebf1ff" label="lyrics-like">tu ipse obdormísti, qui scrutándo</l><l xml:id="m-cc5168ab-8140-44d3-9b30-682bfb0483cb" facs="#m-d2941662-b568-40c4-b8e2-2adc4d8c44fa" label="lyrics-like">Damus, inquiunt, vobis pecú¬</l><l xml:id="m-e534ce93-2622-42e9-8acc-e1d0a5824752" facs="#m-53f299c1-1361-48fa-8d6b-de81ec03081a" label="lyrics-like">tália defecísti.</l><l xml:id="m-aa2f3d3a-7e09-4af0-a563-88ae4a422a18" facs="#m-3a10fc8c-7baf-47c3-afcf-69f237415cbb" label="ambiguous">niam: et dicite quia vobis</l><l xml:id="m-821d8f0e-075e-4def-87cc-dba5742628ca" facs="#m-32429c9d-10f9-42d5-a433-76f3aa5de54c" label="lyrics-like">dormiéntibus venérunt discipuli</l><l xml:id="m-31c3fd57-68ad-40ed-864d-f1db99e4a074" facs="#m-2a404910-2cdd-49fb-8f6b-9359d4a041fd" label="ambiguous">mesp-o!</l><l xml:id="m-378530f7-71a8-4a82-bc18-ea7df7444c4d" facs="#m-a59ad8f0-5cf3-4d84-a0b6-b1b2df3de711" label="lyrics-like">C- ce “ quómodo mó-ri-tur jú-stus,</l><l xml:id="m-6cd35a1b-73af-4a90-8b06-ab15c4e89bf3" facs="#m-e831ad89-81a4-4df8-a7df-796d8e45bd60" label="lyrics-like">et né- mo</l><l xml:id="m-07127ba3-f026-44ac-9c09-b2c8d34387db" facs="#m-6bd17274-1faf-4b1a-b24b-fb393e17b841" label="lyrics-like">et ví-ri jústi tollún¬ tur,</l><l xml:id="m-3a347d77-72ee-44e3-9b86-ab36bb48bcae" facs="#m-e7b5a654-5cd1-4667-ae35-0dfe37fad205" label="lyrics-like">pér- ci-pit cór-de:</l><l xml:id="m-598591ed-9186-42c6-bc14-1e853f3b0caa" facs="#m-badfefe8-0204-4462-bf4c-acb0d7213fe7" label="ambiguous">et</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>